	(text "USB 1.1 Full Speed (12Mbps) Interface\n\nVBUS: Polyswitch for overcurrent protection (OCP).\nD+/D-: 22 Ohm series resistors for impedance matching.\nShield: 330 Ohm + 0.1uF RC network for ESD protection and EMI mitigation.\n\nSoftware-controlled D+ Pull-up: \nP-MOSFET switch driven by GPIO to delay USB enumeration \nuntil firmware initialization is complete."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 42.164 35.56 0)
